  "notes_to_self": "Turn 9 (t=200s): Ring shrinks 740m -> 660m at t=225s. West Plateau (dist 364-393m) stays safe through t=300s (ring 420m). Plan to begin orderly descent off West Plateau around t=275s into western lowland (x=440-500, z=640-720). Known enemy positions from intel: Green main army at (680,630), Orange scout at (655,575) & main army on Little Hill south of z=600, White 4x Odrysian cav at (658,825) & main army on Central Heights (descending via x=520-660 later).",
